{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of these expressions is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267d8b47864808d179f7b05f9e6a6af8b8a4ad0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin 50^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb07003a55aea9f37b7c6202e5852de0f2e1a834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sin 40^\\circ \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\cos 40^\\circ \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\tan 40^\\circ \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\cos 50^\\circ \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\tan 50^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"589\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41470508df2ceb87f97c7e939589024bceb16e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{x}$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36b4a58066fe1eb15bc242c8f3092853955842e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(90^{\\circ} - x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b76cac5bfaec1467626ab28ebc67071c7dede2e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin{50^{\\circ}} = \\cos{(90^{\\circ} - 50^{\\circ})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"193\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f20400fb5534c739931fcfbd5d06f39d3ee65c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } \\cos 40^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_S